# Pinned refs for the real-collector snapshot job. tools/regen-collector-snapshots.sh sources
# this file (the snapshot workflow invokes that script) — it is the ONE place to bump.
#
# Bumping a pin is a reviewed change, exactly like a dependency bump: open a PR that changes the
# ref here AND commits the regenerated docs/examples/_expected/*.json in the same PR
# (see CONTRIBUTING.md -> "Regenerating the collector snapshots").
#
# Refs MUST be a tag or a full commit SHA. A floating branch name (master, main, ...) is not allowed.

